<title>ESTONIA: FOREKSPANK TO TAKE SYNDICATED LOAN.</title>
<headline>FOREKSPANK TO TAKE SYNDICATED LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forekspank plans to take a syndicated loan worth around 20 million German marks, the bank said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The bank said in a short statement that the loan would be for a term of three years with an intrest rate of libor plus 1.75 percent.</p>
<p>The bank named Deutsche Morgan Grenfell as the arranger of the organiser.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
